OL,3,GNEWSAIslamic centre overwhelmed by
OL,4,Asupport after damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at an Islamic community centre
OL,7,Ftargeted by vandals have spoken of
OL,8,Famazing offers of support in the
OL,9,Faftermath - as they released CCTV of
OL,10,Fthe crime.
OL,12,FHassan Kilik, a voluntary Imam at the
OL,13,FCornwall Islamic Community Centre near
OL,14,FTruro, said they had received flowers,
OL,15,Fmoney and offers of free repair work.
OL,17,FDevon and Cornwall Police has described
OL,18,Fthe incident as "racially aggravated
OL,19,Fcriminal damage".
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
