OL,3,GNEWSAIslamic centre overwhelmed by
OL,4,Asupport after damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building on Quenchwell Road was
OL,7,Ftargeted on Thursday, causing
OL,8,F"substantial damage" to metal entrance
OL,9,Fgates, thought to have been caused by a
OL,10,Fvehicle, while a substance suspected to
OL,11,Fbe oil was poured on the grounds and
OL,12,Fwall.
